### Data source {#s2-2-5}

How much pain did your patient experience during injection? Were they present during the whole procedure? And how much pain did they experience during the injection? Please give me a sentence or few sentences describing the pain: 0 = no pain, 1 = mild, 2 = moderate, 3 = severe.

### Cite reference {#s2-2-6}

 The personal opinion which should be formed from the article (provided in the main body of the response) should be entirely in the summary. An example from this current article (on a recent tragic incident) may be: "In a shocking incident, eight dead and one seriously injured, a drunk man was shot dead by four Dallas police officers at a rest stop near Houston on Sunday night." I would recommend providing a short commentary only when the information above is not available.

